description:
工作职责：
1. 负责肿瘤模型的构建和抗肿瘤待测化合物的体内筛选；
2. 配合项目主管设计新药筛选的体内药效学实验并开展相关研究以及项目文件、样品、材料等物资的整理工作；
3. 及时、准确、完整、科学地记录实验结果，审核数据，分析问题，总结实验结果并撰写研究报告；
4. 能够根据项目需要，完成文献检索并进行相关调研报告的撰写；

Responsibilities:
1. Responsible for the construction of tumor models and in vivo anti-tumor compound screening； 
2. Cooperate with the study director to design in vivo pharmacodynamics experiments and carry out relevant studies;
3. Record experimental results in a timely, accurate, complete and scientific manner, review data, analyze problems, summarize experimental results and write study reports; 
4. Conduct literature search and write study reports according to project requirements;

requirements:
任职资格：
1. 肿瘤、免疫学、生物学等相关专业硕士学历；
2. 具有独立分析问题和解决问题的能力；
3. 熟悉大鼠和小鼠的基本实验操作，同时掌握分子和细胞相关技能者优先；
4. 吃苦耐劳、责任心强，有较强的学习能力和团队合作精神；

Qualifications:
1. Master's degree in tumor, immunology, biology or other related field;
2. Ability to analyze and solve problems independently;
3. Familiar with the basic operation of rats and mice, and master molecular or cellular related skills is a plus;
4. Hard-working and responsible, strong learning ability and good team spirit.

Qualifications and Requirements:
 A PhD Degree in Biochemistry, Cell Biology, Pharmacology or related area;
 Hands-on expertise in developing and validating robust biochemical and cell-based assays;
 Demonstrated ability to independently design and execute experiments and trouble-shooting;
 Written and oral communication skills in both Chinese and English, able to read and comprehend Chinese and English literatures, and able to write experimental reports in both languages;
 Excellent data analysis, problem-solving, and critical thinking skills;
 Strong communication and collaboration skills with the ability to work effectively in a multidisciplinary team environment;
 Highly organized, detail-oriented, and capable of handling multiple projects in a fast-paced environment.

Preferred Qualifications:
 Working experience in the industry.
 Hands-on experience with laboratory automation, liquid handlers (e.g., Echo, Certus, I.DoT, Multidrop Combi, Agilent Bravo), plate readers (e.g., EnVision, PheraStar), and HTS data analysis software (e.g., Spotfire, GeneData Screener).
 Knowledge of cutting-edge technologies such as Mass Spectrometry, Single-cell Sequencing and Machine-learning.

